      "writtenOn": "2024-09-13T21:42:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i have mixed feelings about moving this to the platform level since\nit probably impacts EC behavior more than platform behavior.\na new EC may need this more than a validated EC, so i\u0027d be OK\nwith configuring this for specific ECs.\n\noften, `SYSTEM_UNLOCKED` modifies system behavior in ways that\nhides problems in the short term and i\u0027d strive to remove this\nas soon as possible. do we even need it now?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 6,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "74632f162e689f456f2b7ee03c275cc98d1c32c8",
