      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T17:35:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we have CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_BYPASS_CBI_EEPROM_WP_CHECK enabled at line 50.\nWe can remove CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SYSTEM_UNLOCKED together for all PTLRVP SKU once CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_BYPASS_CBI_EEPROM_WP_CHECK is removed.\n\nAny preference on keeping it common or separately defined for each board?",
